des zero). The 1991\u20132020 normal is 37.6 inches a year. The wettest year was 2010 (54.13 in); the driest, 1956 (22.87 in).","show_snow":true,"sig_bars":{"lo":false,"hi":false},"t_year":"2026 so far: 7 daily record highs, no daily record lows"}}